 *
 * transfCayley2V1 based on Cayley2IFS
 * @reference
 * http://www.fractalforums.com/mandelbulb-3d/custom-formulas-and-transforms-release-t17106/

 * This file has been autogenerated by tools/populateUiInformation.php
